  "heading": "Definition of British officer.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 194,
  "text": "(1) In this Chapter \"British officer\" means a person of nonIndian domicile holding a commission in His Majesty's Air Force and serving in the Air Force.\n\n(2) The expression \"superior officer\" in this Act shall be deemed to include a British officer.",
